abstract: >-
  Experiment code for a study of premise attacks on agentic selection: whether
  a false factual claim about a competitor, carrying no instruction and
  published by a lawful participant, moves an LLM agent's choice, and where a
  defense must be placed to separate it from benign traffic. The stored model
  responses, hand labels and append-only ledgers are published as a separate
  data release.
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - agentic AI
  - prompt injection
  - authorization
  - trust and provenance
